'' TKO0836-TKO0842 -- ARRAY RESULTS, 'function f( ) as T( )', a tiko extension (fbc's error 3).
'' The parentheses used to vanish: 'as integer( 3 )' compiled as a plain integer function, and an
'' array result that could not be given away (a parameter, a shared array, a copy) or that was
'' converted to a scalar, or passed to a scalar parameter, compiled and crashed or
'' stored nothing. TKO0612 stays what fbc says
'' of an initialised dynamic array, and a declaration written 'as integer( )' must be
'' defined 'as integer( )' (TKO0793). See symbols/arrresult.bas and parser/declparam.bas.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/array-result-errors.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-errors.bas(1,26): error TKO0836: an array result is written 'as T( )', with nothing between the parentheses
'' ...and, the result being no array, its 'return { 1 }' is a brace list where none is allowed --
'' fbc's error 9 on the same line (braceinit.bas).
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-errors.bas(2,12): error TKO0846: a '{ ... }' list can only initialize an array
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-errors.bas(5,33): error TKO0837: a procedure type cannot return an array; return it from a named procedure
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-errors.bas(8,5): error TKO0838: this function returns an array
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-errors.bas(12,14): error TKO0839: a nested brace list cannot be returned as an array result; write a flat list
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-errors.bas(16,5): error TKO0840: 'a' is not a local array of this procedure
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-errors.bas(20,5): error TKO0838: this function returns an array
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-errors.bas(25,5): error TKO0840: 'g' is not a local array of this procedure
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-errors.bas(30,5): error TKO0838: this function returns an array
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-errors.bas(33,5): error TKO0612: var-len array 'd' cannot be initialized
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-errors.bas(35,22): error TKO0842: this call returns an array, which cannot be converted to another type
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-errors.bas(36,9): error TKO0841: 'a2' returns an array, so it must be called with parentheses: 'a2( )'
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-errors.bas(38,1): error TKO0842: this call returns an array
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-errors.bas(41,5): error TKO0842: this call returns an array
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-errors.bas(45,1): error TKO0793: the result of 'a10' does not match its declaration
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-result-errors.bas(52,19): error TKO0842: this call returns an array
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 16
